  "description": "Fen Turnstile\u2019s opening falls a whole tone into a G-minor miniature. The left hand offers two quiet chord answers on the last eighth of each dotted-quarter pulse, then shifts those same gestures onto the pulse itself. The melody keeps its own lilt while the accompaniment alternately leans behind and steps forward.",
